WEBVTT

00:13:31.583 --> 00:13:33.559
So in summary,

00:13:33.583 --> 00:13:36.750
our new story could go
something like this.

00:13:38.667 --> 00:13:41.059
Disorder afflicts the land!

00:13:41.083 --> 00:13:42.101
(Laughter)

00:13:42.125 --> 00:13:44.476
Caused by the powerful
and nefarious forces

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:48.518
of people who say
there's no such thing as society,

00:13:48.542 --> 00:13:51.893
who tell us that
our highest purpose in life

00:13:51.917 --> 00:13:55.375
is to fight like stray dogs
over a dustbin.

00:13:56.708 --> 00:13:59.726
But the heroes of the story, us,

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:02.434
we'll revolt against this disorder.